# Harness outputs (generated at runtime, NOT tracked). The leaderboard AND the
# homepage viz (field.json/graph.json) build from the Supabase scoreboard — the
# system of record — not from local run logs (founder directive 2026-06-16).
# Report JSONs are no longer re-included here.
eval/cache/
eval/logs/*
# The baseline sweep manifest is load-bearing CONFIG (model lineup + cost
# basis) that generate_sweep_queue.py requires — track it, not an artifact.
!eval/logs/sweep_manifest.json
eval/probes/

# Demo outputs (may contain third-party corpus data — generate locally)
eval_demo/

# Dashboard output (generated HTML)
dashboard_output.html
dashboard.html

# Type checking
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
website/.docusaurus/
